    <title>028.25岁扛下40万亏损,她如何把声无哀乐从200粉带到20万粉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685be79d08d8fd8586f3eb30</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685be79d08d8fd8586f3eb30</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Jun 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嘉宾：阿瑞（</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7329946826" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7329946826"><span>声无哀乐</span></a><span>乐队经纪人、</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7877341408" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7877341408"><span>武汉回授livehouse</span></a><span>主理人）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：大澍（🍠：</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b47674c4eacab119a3717c6?xsec_token=YBaH3Q3th_bcJeIFcKtto3qihEtgbF0NbQKOJz7rfusgA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b47674c4eacab119a3717c6&amp;apptime=1750940170&amp;share_id=0f3778918ceb4676a59485ae004e22d6" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b47674c4eacab119a3717c6?xsec_token=YBaH3Q3th_bcJeIFcKtto3qihEtgbF0NbQKOJz7rfusgA=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5b47674c4eacab119a3717c6&amp;apptime=1750940170&amp;share_id=0f3778918ceb4676a59485ae004e22d6"><span>刘没六儿</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎添加小助手【YizuoYiwang_】进听友群</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>阿瑞，武汉title Queen，目前有的title包括但不限于：声无哀乐/</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/6369581335" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/6369581335"><span>克林尼克</span></a><span>/</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/5834355703" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/5834355703"><span>泥塑上帝</span></a><span>经纪人、回授livehouse主理人、</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/671cbbd0000000000d0251c1?xsec_token=YBEHw-pM2PF_fU82rR26ujjHjGxmGyWbT5tsERLxDc-r0=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5c0d1cde6b58b71457f58ae6&amp;apptime=1750941569&amp;share_id=2837156407504141a684f9f8567b5455" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/671cbbd0000000000d0251c1?xsec_token=YBEHw-pM2PF_fU82rR26ujjHjGxmGyWbT5tsERLxDc-r0=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5c0d1cde6b58b71457f58ae6&amp;apptime=1750941569&amp;share_id=2837156407504141a684f9f8567b5455"><span>武汉CH8Livehouse</span></a><span>股东、</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/61a1ce73000000001000faa3?xsec_token=YBbOra7Um15g3JEI2blEc-VqLhGdzf3ngydV7xrn2Xw-E=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5c0d1cde6b58b71457f58ae6&amp;apptime=1750941504&amp;share_id=9ac57bbdbcb9473fadf55c8f7b8fd291" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/61a1ce73000000001000faa3?xsec_token=YBbOra7Um15g3JEI2blEc-VqLhGdzf3ngydV7xrn2Xw-E=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=WeixinSession&amp;appuid=5c0d1cde6b58b71457f58ae6&amp;apptime=1750941504&amp;share_id=9ac57bbdbcb9473fadf55c8f7b8fd291"><span>百家工作室排练室</span></a><span>老板、</span><a href="https://weibo.com/u/7330214103" data-url="https://weibo.com/u/7330214103"><span>争酌厂牌</span></a><span>主理人（以上排名不分先后）</span></p><span></span><p><span>20岁进入业内，同年大学退学，gap两年后又重回音乐行业，27岁在武汉建立自己的“音乐商业版图”（半开玩笑）</span></p><span></span><p><span>阿瑞是如何与声无哀乐结缘的，又是如何当上他们的经纪人带领他们一路走到今天？从网易云400粉丝到今天20万粉丝，中间经历了哪些？这些经验是可以复制的？放在今天是否还有借鉴和参考意义？</span></p><span></span><p><span>又是什么契机选择定居武汉，并在武汉开一家小型livehouse、还有一个排练室的？</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢声无哀乐，或是你也在玩乐队，再或者你想知道如何做一名优秀的经纪人，这期节目千万不要错过！</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 这么厉害的经纪人居然也考不过演出经纪人资格证？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 本来只想做乐迷组织，没想到做着做着做成了经纪人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 如何发现并签约声无哀乐的？（A&amp;R小伙伴一定要听！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1254">20:54</a> 给年轻乐队和经纪人寻找合作伙伴的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1340">22:20</a> 声无哀乐成功的运营模式放到现在还适用吗？是可复制的吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 滚圈就没有见人下菜碟的人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a> 聊聊网红武汉朋克夫妇在回授的结婚典礼！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（欢迎点击观看</span><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/672479c533c798676fa32cf8/685be79d08d8fd8586f3eb30/%F0%9F%98%86%20sMoWWqIfyo7QOoC%20%F0%9F%98%86%20http://xhslink.com/m/4Vfafh4Qh22" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/672479c533c798676fa32cf8/685be79d08d8fd8586f3eb30/%F0%9F%98%86%20sMoWWqIfyo7QOoC%20%F0%9F%98%86%20http://xhslink.com/m/4Vfafh4Qh22"><span>纪念武汉最混乱的婚礼现场</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 阿瑞为什么会选择定居武汉并且开livehouse？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3030">50:30</a> 武汉有20家演出场地？武汉到底有谁在啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3215">53:35</a> 阿瑞的多重身份会互相影响吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4190">69:50</a>【听友来信】为什么感觉声无哀乐今年整体演出变少了？音乐节去的也少了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4356">72:36</a>【听友来信】声无哀乐接下来还有什么计划吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>制作人员：</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑整理、文案：大澍</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目中的音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>声音碎片《优美的低于生活》</span></p><span></span><p><span>声无哀乐《去时风》</span></p>]]></description>
